{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-4-3:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_4_3\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk_v2_n_4_3_intro\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章应说明U2 6 mg组、U2 12 mg组和安慰剂组在52周治疗期内的给药方案、给药途径、起始剂量、最大计划给药量及剂量选择依据。已确认的52周治疗期给药方案见下表；表中缺失字段应待项目确认后补充，不得以模板示例或通用默认值替代。整体研究设计结构化信息【待补充：整体研究设计结构化信息：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk_v2_n_4_3_dose_table\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"tbl_v2_n_4_3_dose\",\n        \"block_id\": \"blk_v2_n_4_3_dose_table\",\n        \"title\": \"表1 U2与安慰剂给药方案及剂量字段\",\n        \"domain\": \"treatment_dose\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_field\",\n            \"label\": \"字段\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"field_name\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_value\",\n            \"label\": \"项目确认内容\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"field_value\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_route\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"label\": \"研究药物给药途径\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"cell_field_investigational_route\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_route\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_field\",\n                \"text\": \"研究药物给药途径\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"dose:investigational-route\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_route\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_value\",\n                \"text\": \"口服（依据已确认给药方案中的U2 6 mg组和U2 12 mg组记录）；【待补充：研究药物给药途径：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_regimen\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"label\": \"研究药物给药方案\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"cell_field_investigational_regimen\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_regimen\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_field\",\n                \"text\": \"研究药物给药方案\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"dose:investigational-regimen\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_investigational_regimen\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_value\",\n                \"text\": \"U2 6 mg组：每日1次，每次1片U2（6 mg片剂）加1片安慰剂片，52周治疗期内持续每日给药；U2 12 mg组：每日1次，每次2片U2（6 mg片剂），52周治疗期内持续每日给药。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_comparator_route\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"label\": \"对照药给药途径\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"cell_field_comparat